{
  "_": "Logo animations as data. Units: ms for time; dx/dy in cells (one cell = 1/8 of the mark); scale around the element's centre; tint 0..1 blends toward the counter colour (frame → accent, corner → ink, glyph → accent). Orders for cells: reading, columns, clockwise, counter, ring, from-corner, to-corner, from-center, random (a fresh order every run) or random:<seed> (fixed). Orders for glyphs: ltr, rtl, center-out, edges-in, random:<seed>. A track holds its first keyframe before it starts and its last after it ends unless before/after is \"none\"; wrap runs it modulo the animation duration. Target \"pixels\" takes an \"art\": eight rows of eight characters, \"#\" lit, \".\" dark — the pixel layer is invisible at rest and sits on the whole 8×8 grid; orders: reading, columns, from-center, from-corner, random:<seed>. A pixels track may \"morph\" into \"mark\", \"corner\" or \"frame\": every lit pixel gets a nearest free cell, and the keyframe prop \"move\" (0..1) walks it there. Targets \"landed\"/\"unlanded\" are the cells a morph track of the same animation hands over to, and the others. \"accent\" (0..1) blends toward the brand petrol. A morph track with \"colour\": \"landing\" tints pixels bound for the corner petrol on the way.",
